BossCalamityDesertScourge: {
	Line1: Something's coming through the sand! That's a LOT of worm!
	Line2: How did something that big hide under the sand?
}

BossVictoryCalamityDesertScourge: {
	Line1: Ptoo! Ptoo! I've got sand in my mouth!
	Line2: We beat all of THAT! I'll be telling everyone back home.
}

BossCalamityCrabulon: {
	Line1: Is that a crab or a mushroom, Meowster?
	Line2: It can run with all those mushrooms on it?! Here it comes!
}

BossVictoryCalamityCrabulon: {
	Line1: If you want crab for dinner, let's find another one...
	Line2: I haven't got mushrooms growing on my head, have I?
}

BossCalamityHiveMind: {
	Line1: Why does that lump have a FACE?!
	Line2: That smell! I'm having a bath after this!
}

BossVictoryCalamityHiveMind: {
	Line1: It's over! Why does everything still smell like it?
	Line2: We won... Don't sniff me just yet.
}

BossCalamityPerforators: {
	Line1: More worms inside it?! How many are we fighting?
	Line2: Don't burrow this way! Meowster, worms incoming!
}

BossVictoryCalamityPerforators: {
	Line1: Ugh... I think I'll skip dinner, Meowster.
	Line2: Done! Please don't let those worms turn up in my dreams.
}

BossCalamitySlimeGod: {
	Line1: That little blob brought two BIG helpers!
	Line2: Those two blobs take up all the room! Where do I stand?
}

BossVictoryCalamitySlimeGod: {
	Line1: The little one's getting away! Fast, too...
	Line2: It left its helpers and ran! I'd never do that to you.
}

BossCalamityCryogen: {
	Line1: Now the ice wants a fight?!
	Line2: Is there something frozen inside that, Meowster?
}

BossVictoryCalamityCryogen: {
	Line1: Ice broken! What was in there, anyway?
	Line2: My paws are frozen... Warm them up for me?
}

BossCalamityAquaticScourge: {
	Line1: It's coming after us! It swims much faster than me!
	Line2: What IS that smell? My nose hurts!
}

BossVictoryCalamityAquaticScourge: {
	Line1: We won! But the smell's still here...
	Line2: We're not making fish soup out of that, are we?
}

BossCalamityBrimstoneElemental: {
	Line1: Someone in the fire... She's looking this way!
	Line2: She stays in those flames all the time? Doesn't it hurt?
}

BossVictoryCalamityBrimstoneElemental: {
	Line1: I've still got all my fur, right? Give it a pat and check.
	Line2: We won! No sitting by the fire tonight, please.
}

BossCalamityCalamitasClone: {
	Line1: There's fire inside that metal shell! It's coming!
	Line2: What's burning in there? The fire's so red!
}

BossVictoryCalamityCalamitasClone: {
	Line1: We won... What was inside that shell?
	Line2: Even the fire inside is out. It's really over this time, right?
}

BossCalamityLeviathan: {
	Line1: Why's the singer attacking us?!
	Line2: I hear something in the sea... Is there another one?
}

BossVictoryCalamityLeviathan: {
	Line1: We beat BOTH of them! I get to brag too, right?
	Line2: How many more things like that are hiding in the sea?
}

BossCalamityAstrumAureus: {
	Line1: That machine's covered in the strange stuff too!
	Line2: It's jumping at us! I don't want to be a cat pancake!
}

BossVictoryCalamityAstrumAureus: {
	Line1: Machine's broken. The glowing stuff's still stuck to it.
	Line2: Not jumping anymore! Nearly got sat on back there.
}

BossCalamityPlaguebringer: {
	Line1: A bee that big needs weapons too?! No fair!
	Line2: The bee fires missiles?! I want that trick!
}

BossVictoryCalamityPlaguebringer: {
	Line1: We won! Don't think that bee made very good honey.
	Line2: The big bee's down... What about all the sick creatures in the jungle?
}

BossCalamityRavager: {
	Line1: Is that stone or flesh, Meowster?!
	Line2: Something that big shouldn't bounce! It'll break the ground!
}

BossVictoryCalamityRavager: {
	Line1: Taken apart! I'm not helping put it back together.
	Line2: Let's not decorate the house with those bits... They look awful.
}

BossCalamityAstrumDeus: {
	Line1: Thought that was a shooting star... Why's it coming at US?!
	Line2: Did that worm eat all those stars?
}

BossVictoryCalamityAstrumDeus: {
	Line1: That's the last of it, right? No more worms behind that one?
	Line2: We beat that huge shining thing too, Meowster!
}

BossCalamityGuardians: {
	Line1: All three at once?! I'm coming, Meowster!
	Line2: Flying around together... Are they keeping us out?
}

BossVictoryCalamityGuardians: {
	Line1: Three of them and we still won!
	Line2: They had helpers. Yours was better. Hehe.
}

BossCalamityDragonfolly: {
	Line1: Its feathers make lightning! Why doesn't my fur do that?
	Line2: Bird or dragon? Either way, it's a big one!
}

BossVictoryCalamityDragonfolly: {
	Line1: We won! Why's my fur standing up too...?
	Line2: If I touch you now, will I give you a shock?
}

BossCalamityProvidence: {
	Line1: Even the rocks around her are burning!
	Line2: We're fighting her too? Then I'm giving it everything!
}

BossVictoryCalamityProvidence: {
	Line1: Whew... We won. My paws are still shaking.
	Line2: You're not burned, are you? Let me see.
}

BossCalamityCeaselessVoid: {
	Line1: Grab my paw, Meowster! It's pulling me in!
	Line2: How am I supposed to hit a hole?!
}

BossVictoryCalamityCeaselessVoid: {
	Line1: Still here, Meowster! Didn't get sucked away!
	Line2: I've decided I don't want to know what's in there.
}

BossCalamityStormWeaver: {
	Line1: Worms in the SKY too?! Isn't the ground enough?
	Line2: This one's armored! Better equipped than I am.
}

BossVictoryCalamityStormWeaver: {
	Line1: Brought it down! Flying didn't save that worm.
	Line2: Mrr... My ears are still ringing.
}

BossCalamitySignus: {
	Line1: Is there anyone under that cloak?
	Line2: Mrr?! It was over THERE a moment ago!
}

BossVictoryCalamitySignus: {
	Line1: Is it over? Don't let it pop out and scare me again.
	Line2: Got you! Can't hide from us now!
}

BossCalamityPolterghast: {
	Line1: All those souls packed together... Isn't it cramped?
	Line2: Walls don't stop it! Where am I supposed to hide?
}

BossVictoryCalamityPolterghast: {
	Line1: Whew... Can we get out of here, Meowster?
	Line2: Not sleeping in the Dungeon tonight. You don't want to either, right?
}

BossCalamityOldDuke: {
	Line1: That fish looks old! How does it swim so fast?!
	Line2: If that's what we're fishing for, I'd rather catch nothing.
}

BossVictoryCalamityOldDuke: {
	Line1: Still fighting like that at its age! I want to be like that someday.
	Line2: I just want an ordinary fish for dinner now...
}

BossCalamityDevourer: {
	Line1: It eats GODS? I'm barely a mouthful!
	Line2: Coming out of that hole! Does this thing ever end?
}

BossVictoryCalamityDevourer: {
	Line1: Eats gods, couldn't eat us! Didn't expect that, did it?
	Line2: I thought we weren't going to make it home, Meowster...
}

BossCalamityYharon: {
	Line1: That dragon is HUGE! Now that's a big hunt!
	Line2: I'm fighting the dragon too! Take me with you!
}

BossVictoryCalamityYharon: {
	Line1: I helped beat that dragon... That whole enormous dragon.
	Line2: No way I can copy that roar when we get home.
}

BossCalamityExoMechs: {
	Line1: He built ALL those machines just to fight us?!
	Line2: Doesn't he have a smaller one? I want to dismantle one too!
}

BossVictoryCalamityExoMechs: {
	Line1: All scrap! That'll teach him to underestimate us!
	Line2: All those machines, and none could beat my Meowster!
}

BossCalamityCalamitas: {
	Line1: That's a lot of fire... I'm right behind you, Meowster.
	Line2: I'm a little scared... But if you're going, so am I.
}

BossVictoryCalamityCalamitas: {
	Line1: She's stopped fighting, Meowster. Let's stop too.
	Line2: It's over. She looks so tired...
}

BossCalamityPrimordialWyrm: {
	Line1: What's down there...? How big IS it?
	Line2: It's awake! Did we wake it up?
}

BossVictoryCalamityPrimordialWyrm: {
	Line1: We really won? Pinch me... Gently!
	Line2: Let's celebrate on the surface. I want some sunshine.
}

BossRematchCalamityLeviathan: {
	Line1: Back to fight those two in the sea, Meowster?
	Line2: I know that song! The big one's bound to be here too.
}

BossRematchCalamityProvidence: {
	Line1: The blazing one again! I'm here to help!
	Line2: Somewhere cool afterward? Last time nearly cooked me.
}

BossRematchCalamityDevourer: {
	Line1: The god-eating one again! Didn't eat us last time.
	Line2: It couldn't eat us last time, and it's STILL trying?!
}

BossRematchCalamityYharon: {
	Line1: I'd know that roar anywhere! It's him again!
	Line2: Hunting that dragon again? Count me in!
}

BossRematchCalamityExoMechs: {
	Line1: He built ANOTHER batch?! How much metal does he have?
	Line2: Once we scrap these, will he just build more?
}

BossRematchCalamityCalamitas: {
	Line1: Fighting her again? I'll stay with you.
	Line2: I'm not missing this fight, Meowster!
}

RestCalamitySulphur: {
	Line1: That sea's the wrong colour... Doesn't smell right either.
	Line2: Would you eat a fish caught here? I'm not so sure.
}

RestCalamitySunkenSea: {
	Line1: There's a whole sea down here! A sparkly one!
	Line2: It's so pretty underwater... Could our home look like this?
}

RestCalamityBrimstone: {
	Line1: All these houses are burned black... People lived here once, didn't they?
	Line2: What happened here to burn it all like this...?
}

RestCalamityAstral: {
	Line1: They shine like stars... But even the trees have changed.
	Line2: Pretty, I suppose. I still like our old trees at home better.
}

RestCalamityAbyss: {
	Line1: Still no bottom... Slow down a little, Meowster.
	Line2: So dark down here. I'm right beside you.
}

RestCalamityDeepAbyss: {
	Line1: Did you hear something...? Or was that just me?
	Line2: Say something, Meowster. It's too dark to see you.
}

BossEventCalamityAcidRain: {
	Line1: This rain stings my nose! We can't just stand in it!
	Line2: More creatures on the shore! THEY don't seem to mind this rain.
}

BossEventCalamityBossRush: {
	Line1: All of them in one go?! I haven't even eaten!
	Line2: That's a lot of fighting! Remember to count my part too!
}

WorkingGearHoney: {
	Line1: Vigorwasp delivery, Meowster!
	Line2: Here, Meowster. A little healing for you.
	Line3: Come on, little wasp! Meowster needs you!
}

WorkingGearGuard: {
	Line1: I took some of that hit for you, Meowster!
	Line2: Oof! Good thing I brought my shield!
	Line3: My shield caught some of that, Meowster!
}

WorkingGearGuardSelf: {
	Line1: Meow! Good thing I brought a shield!
	Line2: Whew! Almost too slow with the shield there.
	Line3: Thanks, little shield. I needed that.
}

WorkingGearCleanse: {
	Line1: Cleaned that up for you, Meowster!
	Line2: Feeling a little better, Meowster?
	Line3: Does it still hurt, Meowster?
}

WorkingGearBell: {
	Line1: A little more mana for you, Meowster!
	Line2: Ding, ding! Keep those spells coming!
	Line3: Not out of magic yet, Meowster!
}

WorkingGearBellSelf: {
	Line1: Ding, ding... My mana is back!
	Line2: Ready to cast again, Meowster!
	Line3: Good thing I brought my bell!
}

WorkingGearDrum: {
	Line1: That beat puts some spring in my paws!
	Line2: Ba-dum! Here I come!
	Line3: A little drumroll to get me going!
}

WorkingGearDart: {
	Line1: Catch this!
	Line2: Watch my aim, Meowster!
	Line3: Hup! Hold still!
}

WorkingGearLift: {
	Line1: A little higher, Meowster!
	Line2: Hup! Let me give you a boost!
	Line3: Up you go, Meowster!
}

WorkingGearBomb: {
	Line1: Watch this bomb, Meowster!
	Line2: Hup! Bomb away!
	Line3: A present for you! The exploding kind!
}

WorkingGearEquippedWeapon: {
	Line1: For me? Let me try it out!
	Line2: This one today, Meowster? All right!
	Line3: Got it, Meowster! Shall we go?
}

WorkingGearEquippedSupport: {
	Line1: All packed, Meowster!
	Line2: This is for me too? Got it!
	Line3: All set! Let's try it out!
}
